            <ArticleTitle>[Lipid metabolism in occupational chronic bronchitis associated with diabetes mellitus].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>27-32</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The study of 311 patients with chronic occupational bronchitis associated with diabetes mellitus (or diabetes-free) revealed lipid metabolism disorders presenting with overweight, obesity, dyslipoproteinemia. Diabetes mellitus addition to chronic bronchitis increased frequency of lipid metabolism disorders and higher values of lipid state. The revealed lipid metabolism disorders were more marked in the females.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
